1. Overview
The banking application integrates with the organization’s OAuth-based SSO with Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) using Next.js, NextAuth.js, and Spring Boot. The goal is to ensure:

✅ Secure handling of JWT tokens (stored only in HTTP-only cookies).
✅ Server-Side Rendering (SSR) for secure session handling.
